stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Unlabelled: packet 1, conntrack mark 0
    Unlabelled --> Classifying: packet 8, initial record
    Classifying --> Labelled: shield accepts, mark read back
    Classifying --> Unlabelled: timeout, error, reject
    Labelled --> Rechecking: outside its envelope long enough, or routine recheck
    Rechecking --> Labelled: same tin, back off 5 to 40 s
    Rechecking --> Labelled: new tin accepted
    Labelled --> Labelled: verifier undoes a promotion
    Rechecking --> Pinned: third tin change in 60 s
    Pinned --> [*]: connection closes
    Labelled --> [*]: connection closes
    Unlabelled --> [*]: connection closes
    note right of Pinned
        Unlabelled for the rest of its life,
        so plain CAKE
    end note
